  "reading": "Z_star_over_phi_q_N3 (Z*_(q) divided by phi(q)*N^3, the natural per-residue trivial-order normalization) is checked separately for squarefree and non-squarefree q. If mu(q)=0 collapses P_{q,a} to 0 identically (as the definitions force), R_{q,a}=F_N exactly for every a at non-squarefree q, so Z_(q) there carries no bias-subtraction at all, unlike U_(q) which vanishes identically on the same q (RANK3_ROUTE_D.md Section 4)."
